Classification rules (autonomous agent protocol):
- SUCCESS = every phase closed with all expected outputs present and usable.
- PARTIAL = at least one phase closed with a degraded output accepted by the agent (e.g. 3/4 products collected, merge without AI after REPLAN) + justification in `decision_log.jsonl`.
- FAILURE = the campaign ended without a valid PPTX in `_alire/temp/campaign-orchestrator/{SLUG}/reports/` OR user escalation was triggered.

